        "Description": "Good evening, Agent. The Velvet Vanguard has integrated itself into an apex private militia deep in Colorado. They are weaponizing this rogue military force to permanently secure their global networks.\r\rEliminate the embedded syndicate cells:\r• Jacobs (The Hacker)\r• Geiger (The Technician)\r• Powell (The Cook)\r• Hicks (The Demolitionist)\r• Burgess (The Point Man)\r\rDismantle the Vanguard&apos;s military capability before a coordinated strike can be launched. Good luck.",
